    position: pushed into a corner of the frame's interior, touching the frame bbox boundary on all open sides
  frame:
    shape: L-shape (2 sides) or U-shape (3 sides) of a 3-7 x 4-6 bbox, 1-cell thick
    sides: 2-3 adjacent orthogonal sides of the bbox; open side(s) face a grid edge
